  {
   "slug": "services",
   "title": "Services & prices",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"lead\"} --><p class=\"lead\">All prices include parts and labour for a typical family car and are fixed before we start. Performance and electric cars are quoted individually.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Servicing</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"className\":\"service-table\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-table service-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Includes</th><th>Price</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Interim service</td><td>Oil and filter, 30-point check, fluids</td><td>$149</td></tr><tr><td>Full service</td><td>Interim plus air, cabin and fuel filters</td><td>$249</td></tr><tr><td>Major service</td><td>Full plus spark plugs and brake fluid</td><td>$369</td></tr><tr><td>Hybrid &amp; EV health check</td><td>Battery report, coolant, brakes</td><td>$129</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Repairs</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"className\":\"service-table\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-table service-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Job</th><th>Typical time</th><th>Price</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Front brake pads</td><td>1 hour</td><td>$89</td></tr><tr><td>Pads and discs, front</td><td>2 hours</td><td>$239</td></tr><tr><td>Four-wheel alignment</td><td>45 minutes</td><td>$79</td></tr><tr><td>Clutch replacement</td><td>1 day</td><td>from $690</td></tr><tr><td>Timing belt and water pump</td><td>1 day</td><td>from $540</td></tr><tr><td>Diagnostic scan &amp; report</td><td>45 minutes</td><td>$59</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Detailing</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"price-list\"} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list price-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Signature wash</strong> <span class=\"price\">$120</span> <span class=\"desc\">Snow foam, hand wash, wheels, glass and spray sealant · 2 h</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Interior deep clean</strong> <span class=\"price\">$160</span> <span class=\"desc\">Steam, extraction, leather clean and condition · 4 h</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Paint correction</strong> <span class=\"price\">from $380</span> <span class=\"desc\">Removes swirls and light scratches · 1–2 days</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Ceramic coating</strong> <span class=\"price\">from $690</span> <span class=\"desc\">Five-year hydrophobic protection · 2 days</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"section-band\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull section-band\"><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-title\">Meet the crew</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"team-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group team-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:tech-dex}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:tech-dex}}\" alt=\"Portrait illustration of Dex\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:tech-dex}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dex</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"role\"} --><p class=\"role\">Master technician</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Twenty years on everything from vintage roadsters to hybrid estates.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"team-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group team-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:tech-mila}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:tech-mila}}\" alt=\"Portrait illustration of Mila\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:tech-mila}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Mila</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"role\"} --><p class=\"role\">Head of detailing</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Paint correction specialist and the reason our bay is spotless.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"team-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group team-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:tools}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:tools}}\" alt=\"Spanners and sockets\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:tools}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">You?</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"role\"} --><p class=\"role\">We're hiring</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Looking for an apprentice who loves cars and asks good questions.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group -->",
   "featured_media": "tools",
