  {
   "slug": "book-a-service",
   "title": "Book a service",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"lead\"} --><p class=\"lead\">Book online by email or phone, or just drive in for tyres and quick checks. We confirm every booking with a fixed quote.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"feature-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group feature-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Tell us</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Registration, mileage and what you have noticed: noises, lights, smells.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"feature-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group feature-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. We quote</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A fixed price by text before any work starts. No surprises.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"feature-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group feature-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Drive away</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Pay on collection. We show you the old parts and stamp your book.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Courtesy cars</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Two small courtesy cars are available for full services and bigger repairs. Ask when booking; they go fast on Mondays.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"tel:+15550194466\">Call +1 (555) 019-4466</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons -->",
   "menu_order": 2
  },
  {
   "slug": "about",
   "title": "About the garage",
   "content": "<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:workshop}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:workshop}}\" alt=\"The workshop's roller door\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:workshop}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A family workshop with racing in its blood</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Gearhead started in 1998 in a single rented arch under the railway, fixing club racers on weekends and family cars on weekdays. We moved to Foundry Lane in 2011 and now run three lifts and a dedicated detailing bay.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We still race, a little. But mostly we fix cars properly, explain what we did and treat your money as if it were ours.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>If we would not do it to our own car, we will not recommend it for yours.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>Dex, master technician</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our promises</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>A fixed quote before any work starts</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Old parts returned or shown to you</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Twelve months' warranty on parts and labour</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Manufacturer-approved parts and fluids</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list -->",
   "menu_order": 3
  },
  {
   "slug": "contact",
   "title": "Contact",
   "content": "<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Workshop</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Unit 4, Foundry Lane, East Works. Turn in by the blue gate; customer parking on the left.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hours</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Monday – Friday: 7:30 am – 6 pm</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Saturday: 8 am – 1 pm</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Sunday: closed</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Talk to us</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Phone <a href=\"tel:+15550194466\">+1 (555) 019-4466</a><br>Email <a href=\"mailto:workshop@gearhead.example\">workshop@gearhead.example</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Out of hours? Leave your keys and a note in the secure drop box by the gate.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->",
   "menu_order": 4
  }
 ],
 "posts": [
  {
   "slug": "five-checks-before-winter",
   "title": "Five checks before the first frost",
   "date": "2026-10-22T08:00:00",
   "excerpt": "Battery, tyres, coolant, wipers and lights: ten minutes on the driveway that save a cold morning on the hard shoulder.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Cold weather finds every weak spot in a car. Most winter call-outs we attend could have been avoided with a few minutes' checking in October.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} --><ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Battery</strong>: if it cranks slowly, test it now. Batteries over five years old are living on borrowed time.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Tyres</strong>: 3 mm of tread is our minimum for winter, not the legal 1.6 mm.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Coolant</strong>: check the level and the antifreeze strength.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Wipers</strong>: smearing blades are cheap to replace.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Lights</strong>: walk around the car with the lights on.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ol><!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A twenty-dollar battery test is cheaper than a tow truck at six in the morning.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>Dex</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Bring the car in during October and we will run all five checks free while you wait.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "categories": [
    "maintenance"
   ],
   "tags": [
    "winter",
    "tyres"
   ],
   "featured_media": "wheel",
   "format": "standard",
   "sticky": true,
   "comments": [
    {
     "author": "Sam R.",
     "email": "sam.r.@example.com",
     "content": "Had the battery tested after reading this. It was at 40 percent. Replaced just in time.",
     "date": "2026-10-24T18:00:00"
    }
   ]
